{"id":"z01-04","volume":1,"volumeTitle":"周纪一","volumeSubtitle":"前400","index":4,"title":{"t":"安王二年","s":"安王二年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀一 · 前400 · 辛巳","s":"周纪一 · 前400 · 辛巳"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"魏、韩、赵三国一起攻打楚国，军队进到了乘丘。","tokens":[{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"趙","s":"赵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"至","s":"至","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"乘","s":"乘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"丘","s":"丘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"郑国派出军队，把韩国的阳翟围困住。","tokens":[{"t":"鄭","s":"郑","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"圍","s":"围","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陽","s":"阳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"翟","s":"翟","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"韩景侯去世，他的儿子烈侯取继位。","tokens":[{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"景","s":"景","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"薨","s":"薨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"烈","s":"烈","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"赵烈侯去世，赵国的人拥立他的弟弟武侯。","tokens":[{"t":"趙","s":"赵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"烈","s":"烈","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"薨","s":"薨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"國","s":"国","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"弟","s":"弟","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"武","s":"武","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"侯","s":"侯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦简公去世，他的儿子惠公继位。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"簡","s":"简","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"薨","s":"薨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"惠","s":"惠","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"立","s":"立","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"周安王二年，公元前400年。魏、韩、赵一起攻楚，兵锋写到乘丘。郑国则包围韩的阳翟。阳翟是韩的都城，所以这不是边境上随手一触。同一年三国都换君：韩景侯死，儿子烈侯取即位；赵烈侯死，立的不是儿子，而是弟弟武侯；秦简公死，儿子惠公即位。","theme":"本年一面是出兵，魏韩赵攻楚，郑围韩都；一面是三国国君同年去世。赵国的继位尤其要记住：国人立的是烈侯的弟弟，不是烈侯的儿子。这个弟弟就是武侯。后来武侯死时，国人又改立烈侯的太子，本年先把弟弟这条线立起来。","technique":"五句都是短编年，没有对话和评论。军事两句用伐、至、围，只给对象和地点。丧事三句用同一个套式：某侯薨，子或弟某立。赵国一句换成国人立其弟，主语从儿子改成国人，兄弟继位和父子继位就分开了。诸侯死写薨，不写崩。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"薨","reading":"hōng","note":"诸侯死。韩景侯、赵烈侯、秦简公都用这个字。"},{"word":"围","reading":"wéi","note":"包围城邑。郑军围的是阳翟。"},{"word":"阳翟","reading":"yáng dí","note":"韩国都城所在的地方。"},{"word":"国人","reading":"guó rén","note":"赵国国内拥立新君的人。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"其","reading":"qí","note":"其弟的其，指刚刚去世的赵烈侯。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"薨","note":"诸侯死叫薨，天子死才叫崩。不是现代口语里忽然倒下。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"立","reading":"lì","note":"继位，或被拥立为君。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"子烈侯取立","note":"烈侯是谥号，取是名，都放在子的后面，作立的主语。"}]}}
